    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trauma Football is sweeping the nation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of dealing with a mentally unstable boss, nagging journalists and social climbers, all the while having to keep up with top players from all around the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trauma Football features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A gameplay loop unlike anything you've ever seen in a football game (or any sports game, for that matter!) lovingly crafted to keep both newcomers and experts engaged from beginning to end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-An extensive editor that allows you to modify not just the appearance, but also the skills, the formation and the behaviour of your team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A narratively intruguing Season mode with an unmatched variety of challenges and scenarios to test your skills with!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Multiple ways to customize every single game! Put your team of 5 against a team of 8, 11 or just one player, and vice-versa! Set up penalties if your opponent does certain actions, change the weather, the goal size, the time limit, the world is your oyster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Illegal sports betting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A slew of unlockable secrets, mini-games and unique features to keep the player always wanting for more!</p>",
